// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1326884302" "The <color yellow>Shepherds</color> have grown bold of late, going so far as to raid our <i>random uplifting thought salvo</i> caches that we hide in the Shadowed Paths. By twisting these micro-munition memetics into more dubious and fear-ridden forms, they can sow fear into the Last Worders and bolster their ranks thereby.<br><br>First Ward is too fragile for these doomsday cultists to run unchecked with emotion ordnance that they can barely control. I want you to find the Shepherd coven called <color red>{GROUP_NAME}</color> where you can, put down their cult leaders, and retrieve what they've taken from us. Otherwise, more newcomers to the Ward will just become more lost than they normally are."
// AcceptString :
"P421535213" "Lessen the influence of the Shepherds"
// SendOffString :
"P1951464684" "Don't underestimate the Shepherds, {HeroName}. The Vortex seemingly enhances what influence they <i>do</i> possess, and especially in times of anger or fear. For this reason alone, we cannot let them become more of a threat to the Ward."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P915677903" "Search First Ward for Shepherd havens"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1620069356" "Have you recovered our stolen thought ammunition from the Shepherds yet?"
// TaskTitle :
"P4233607597" "<font face=title><color orange>RECOVER EMOTIONAL ORDNANCE FROM THE SHEPHERDS</color></font>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1151175172" "Look for treasure chests. The Shepherds like keeping with the theme of doomsday fanatics of a piratical bent."

